## How it was tested

- `HerbiboarScriptTest` (new, `content:skills:hunter` integration, 5 tests): tunnel XP follows the wiki table; herb level ranges match the wiki table (within two levels); every leg's trail varbit is a footprint varbit and every group can be left; track from every start, stun and harvest; the wrong clue loc changes nothing.
- Fork CI (GitHub Actions: freshCache, buildCache, assemble test integration, boot) green at the commit.
- Not checked in game on this commit (the integration tests cover the flow); the upstream gate's in-game re-check is still to come.

## Checklist

