- [x] State in varbits/varps, not attrs: the trail on the client's own varbits, the harvest count and route length on server varps 63770-63771
- [ ] Matches the OSRS wiki (deviations noted in `docs/quirks.md`): the deviations are listed under Caveats below, not in `docs/quirks.md`
- [ ] New content checked against rsprox dumps where possible (anims, projectiles, sounds, timings): no recording of Herbiboar tracking exists among the 27 local RSProx transcripts, and rsprox.net's index has no topic search; the timings stay as the wiki and the caveats say
- [x] No unrelated or hand-edited generated changes

